<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>PikeBikeCoin (PBC) - Ride the Tide!</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #0077b6, #00b4d8, #90e0ef);
            color: #fff;
            animation: backgroundAnimation 10s infinite alternate;
        }

        @keyframes backgroundAnimation {
            0% { background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #0077b6, #00b4d8, #90e0ef); }
            100% { background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #90e0ef, #00b4d8, #0077b6); }
        }

        header {
            background-color: #023e8a;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 1rem 0;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }

        .container {
            padding: 2rem;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .features {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 2rem;
            margin-top: 2rem;
        }

        .feature {
            border: 2px solid #00b4d8;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            max-width: 300px;
            background: rgba(0, 116, 179, 0.8);
            color: #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
        }

        .feature:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
        }

        footer {
            background-color: #023e8a;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 1rem 0;
            margin-top: 2rem;
        }

        button {
            background-color: #0077b6;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
            font-size: 1rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            border-radius: 5px;
            transition: background-color 0.3s, transform 0.3s;
        }

        button:hover {
            background-color: #0096c7;
            transform: scale(1.1);
        }

        .hero {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 4rem 0;
            background: url('https://example.com/pike-bike.jpg') no-repeat center;
            background-size: cover;
            color: white;
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            margin: 0;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            text-shadow: 1px 1px 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
        }

        .floating-pike {
            position: absolute;
            top: 10%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            animation: float 5s infinite alternate;
        }

        @keyframes float {
            0% { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(0deg); }
            100% { transform: translate(-50%, -45%) rotate(15deg); }
        }

        @keyframes wiggle {
            0%, 100% { transform: rotate(-10deg); }
            50% { transform: rotate(10deg); }
        }

        img:hover {
            animation: wiggle 0.5s infinite;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>PikeBikeCoin (PBC)</h1>
        <p>Ride the tide, pedal to the moon!</p>
    </header>

    <div class="hero">
        <h1>Join the Ride</h1>
        <p>From rivers to the moon, PikeBikeCoin is your ultimate memecoin adventure!</p>
        <button onclick="alert('Welcome to the PikeBikeCoin community!')">Buy PBC Now</button>
    </div>

    <div class="container">
        <h2>Why Choose PikeBikeCoin?</h2>
        <div class="features">
            <div class="feature">
                <h3>🐟 Unique Concept</h3>
                <p>A pike on a bike? Nothing rides waves like this legendary memecoin!</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature">
                <h3>🚴 Community Driven</h3>
                <p>Powered by a passionate and fun-loving crypto community.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature">
                <h3>🌊 Rewards</h3>
                <p>HODL PBC to earn exclusive rewards and participate in NFT drops.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <button onclick="location.href='#roadmap'">Explore Our Roadmap</button>
    </div>

    <div id="roadmap" class="container">
        <h2>Our Roadmap</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Phase 1:</strong> Launch the token and build the community.</li>
            <li><strong>Phase 2:</strong> Exclusive NFT collections featuring the pike on epic bike rides.</li>
            <li><strong>Phase 3:</strong> Partnerships and integrations with top platforms.</li>
            <li><strong>Phase 4:</strong> Pedal all the way to the moon!</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <footer>
        <p>Copyright &copy; 2025 PikeBikeCoin. All rights reserved.</p>
        <p>Follow us on <a href="#" style="color: #00b4d8; text-decoration: none;">Twitter</a> | <a href="#" style="color: #00b4d8; text-decoration: none;">Discord</a> | <a href="#" style="color: #00b4d8; text-decoration: none;">Reddit</a></p>
    </footer>

    <img class="floating-pike" src="https://example.com/floating-pike.png" alt="Pike on a Bike" width="200">
</body>
</html>
